                <td bgcolor="whitesmoke" valign="top"><font color="midnightblue" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="2"><small>Posted&nbsp;-&nbsp;06/28/2004&nbsp;: 2:23:05 PM</small><hr size="1"><span class="spnMessageText"> 1. How many characters do you currently play? <font color="green">4 </font id="green">What are thier levels? <font color="green">62, 38, 37, 24</font id="green"> How long have you played?<font color="green">1 1/2 yrs</font id="green"><br /><br />2. Does your spouse play with you? <font color="green">n/a</font id="green"><br /><br />3. What do your friends think of EQ? <font color="green">Don't say too much about it</font id="green">Do you play amongst a group of friends you socialize with regularly outside of the game?<font color="green">no</font id="green"><br /><br />4. How many hours a week do you usually play EQ? <font color="green">20+</font id="green">Do you find yourself up late at night for guild raids or events?<font color="green">No, right now I just can't sleep</font id="green"><br /><br />5. If your spouse doesn't play the game, does he/she voice an opinion of the game? <font color="green">My fmother hates it (not married) but she doesn't have any hobbies that she does, so she doesn't understand it</font id="green">Do you feel you spend enough time with him/her since they don't play? <font color="green">yes, cause I play in the living room</font id="green"><br /><br />6. Do you feel the game takes away from doing things with your family?<font color="green">definitely, but right now I am having a severe bout of depression and I am not social with anyone, and they think it'a because of the game and it's not, it's because I don't want to think about anything (been dealing with depression for last 9 years)</font id="green"><br /><br />7. Do you know of anyone who has experienced anything positive from playing EQ? <font color="green">you</font id="green"><br /><br />8. Do you honestly feel you could walk away from the game if you had too?<font color="green">no</font id="green"><br /><br />9. Do you remember what caused you to want to play the game?<font color="green">I have always played video games and when I bought my computer my sister had mentioned something about it (she has never played)and it looked like a cool game, so I thought I'd try it; little did I know......</font id="green"><br /><br />10. What are your thoughts of all the bad press EQ gets because people claim it is addictive? <font color="green">they are right, but we all have our demons, could be addicted to worse</font id="green"><br /><br />11. Your name or contact information so my professor can verify my survey source if she so wishes. (she may want to check to make sure you are a real EQ player) <font color="green">Piewakit (Cynthia <a href="mailto:Scarbrough-weezel@grics.net">Scarbrough-weezel@grics.net</a></font id="green">)<br /><br /><br /><font color="green">Good luck Huggs!-let us read your paper when you are done, please!</font id="green"></span></font></td>
