                <td bgcolor="darkgray" valign="top"><font color="midnightblue" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="2"><small>Posted&nbsp;-&nbsp;06/17/2004&nbsp;: 5:06:01 PM</small><hr size="1"><span class="spnMessageText"> 1. How many characters do you currently play? <br />2 actively, maybe 6 altogether<br />What are thier levels? <br />cleric-65, chanter-63<br />How long have you played?<br />4+years<br /><br />2. Does your spouse play with you?<br />divorced thank you :)<br /><br />3. What do your friends think of EQ?<br />most friends like the game, tho dont want to pay for it themselves<br /> Do you play amongst a group of friends you socialize with regularly outside of the game?<br />no<br /><br />4. How many hours a week do you usually play EQ? Do you find yourself up late at night for guild raids or events?<br />about 20 hours a week and yes, Ill stay up late.<br /><br />5. If your spouse doesn't play the game, does he/she voice an opinion of the game? Do you feel you spend enough time with him/her since they don't play? <br />divorced long before EQ<br /><br />6. Do you feel the game takes away from doing things with your family?<br />no...I see my kids on weekends and dont play if we have something to do.<br /><br />7. Do you know of anyone who has experienced anything positive from playing EQ? <br />yea, me.  its nice to get the feelings of accomplishment in the game...even tho it IS a game, its a nice distraction when life can be tough at times. <br /><br />8. Do you honestly feel you could walk away from the game if you had too?<br />yes, but why would I want to?<br /><br />9. Do you remember what caused you to want to play the game?<br />for fun...and it IS fun:)<br /><br /><br />10. What are your thoughts of all the bad press EQ gets because people claim it is addictive? <br />People knock what they dont understand.  TV is way more addictive than EQ, so is playstation, XBOX etc...this is just how we choose to spend our free time!<br /><br /><br />1