                <td bgcolor="darkgray" valign="top"><font color="midnightblue" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="2"><small>Posted&nbsp;-&nbsp;06/16/2004&nbsp;: 10:22:18 AM</small><hr size="1"><span class="spnMessageText"> /1 ahh hell i play alot of toos <img src="http://www.eciunbroken.com/forums/images/crazy_125.gif" border="0" alt="" title="" align="middle" /> 65 ranger 65 cleric 65 chanter 47 warrior and some lowbie alts.. 8 total.<br /><br />/2 MY GF has an account yes<br /><br />/3 no RL friends in game <br /><br />/4 i play alot if i had to guess a time.. id say 40 hours a week<br /><br />/5 well she plays but we are in a situation where we must be at home .. at least 1 of us 24 hours a day. she has a daughter on life support so EQ gives us something to do besides stare at the walls.<br /><br />/6 no it doesnt take away from family the 13 yr old boy even has a toon he plays <br /><br />/7 yea i have heard of ppl gettting married .. meeting in RL all that.<br /><br />/8 yes<br /><br />/9 my GF played EQ before i met her. she is the one that got me into it.<br /><br />/10 gimmie a break if ppl wanna talk about something ..  dont F#$@ around talk about something that actually makes a difference. Heroin cocaine wild kinky sex.. now thats addictive.. this is a game ppl Wake the F@#$ up <img src="http://www.eciunbroken.com/forums/images/icon_smile_tongue.gif" border="0" alt="" title="" align="middle" /><br /><br />/11 contact info .. <a href="mailto:unbrokenelite@yahoo.com">unbrokenelite@yahoo.com</a></span></font></td>
